  "$comment": "Hero looks (docs/hero-looks.md §3.1, §6, §7): the one catalog of coats, nameplate frames and titles a hero may choose. Mirrors LookCatalog in packages/shared/src/types/look.ts. Starter looks are free for every hero and never stored; every other look is held through a receipt on her own look (LookUnlock). Earning them (tiers, class ranks, campaigns, camp) is #669: their rules are listed here so the book and the tests know the whole set. Coats are phase 2 (#666). A frame's painting is UI art (#665) at assets/<art>; until assets/manifest.json -> nameplateFrames.ids lists it as delivered, the plain plate (today's look) is drawn instead and nothing is requested. Titles are kept short: the longest one is what the nameplate collision tests are run with.",
